            "scratchpad/probe_fling3.clj + /tmp/probe_fling3.out: |rel-v| (planet minus STAR velocity, not world-frame) = 43518.5 m/s at tick 4040, essentially unchanged through tick 4045 -- straight-line unbound flight, not integrator divergence"
